        <mxCell id="t12" value="in advance rather than on demand: no temporal coupling, and the copy is behind by one broker hop — which is the trade you are making" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontFamily=Caveat;fontSize=15;fontColor=#8A8578;" vertex="1" parent="1">
